    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual game, players can choose a person carefree, can also choose to form a camp, find a variety of resources, set up their own expedition, across the boundaries of life and death, whether it is the world of life, or the world of death, players have to start from the beginning, when the player in the world of death to the world of life will lose the assets of the dead world, and vice versa. Assets this thing is not born, death naturally can not take away. Between life and death we all come naked, full of refuse to leave.The game added some of my own superficial cognition of Chinese culture, such as the time of day, life and death.(Part of the Chinese cultural game experience requires a certain Chinese language foundation)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game character shown so far is not meant to be the main character, but is definitely one of the resources that will be used in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes: production, combat, and interaction with objects in the scene. Since the game is under development, I will broadcast live on bilibili at least 3 days a week. I will update the announcement video on 10th Beijing time every month until the game development is completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ Group: 827863632\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0the answer is\uff1aSteam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The song in the video has nothing to do with the game itself, just the background music of the video, if the author does not allow, please contact me, I immediately rectify</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently completed functions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4/10update</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game image quality\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579240/extras/940ad6a02d03477f91036f10c28fd2c8.avif?t=1746850127\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><